{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"sec\":\"S06\",\"mech\":\"M56\",\"why\":\"M56明确写出“他越能安心待在这里，越会在时间流逝时生出舍不得”，并补充“温柔持续得越久，越舍不得其中已经过去的部分”，可以确立这份安宁并非一闪即逝，而是曾有一段可以安心停留的时间。它从疲惫后的轻松与安静，逐渐发展到温柔、感激、幸福，再到不舍和淡淡的伤感，符合该段自身的听感；这种变化也能从此前反复追赶、难以被理解的疲惫中自然推出，无须编造额外经历。\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cab6135f-c374-47fc-90f2-a8841100ca5a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T002234413664Z", "elapsed_seconds": 75.469, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T00:23:49.900232+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ffb3a49295f32c2ea635ce1894f61f281ee4000172c8287eebf424937e8897e7", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2a